{"data": {"node": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "8730228070435331", "organization": {"id": "1046419036543724", "viewer_permissions": [], "application_groupings": {"nodes": [{"viewer_has_update_access": false, "full_applications": {"nodes": [{"id": "8730228070435331"}]}, "id": "764494196131177"}, {"viewer_has_update_access": false, "full_applications": {"nodes": [{"id": "8003624246325065"}]}, "id": "7842632312485140"}]}}, "firstRevision": {"nodes": [{"application": {"id": "8730228070435331", "release_date": 1771676460, "is_concept": false, "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "27096080943423431"}, "id": "1262112292244262"}]}}, "binary": null, "live_binary": null, "created_date": 1791698941, "id": "26888803510817843", "is_initial_release": false, "name_with_fallback": "v7", "pdp_metadata_with_fallback": {"version": 5, "application": {"is_concept": false, "latest_released_pdp_metadata": {"id": "26984684964563030"}, "release_status": "RELEASED", "id": "8730228070435331"}, "id": "26984684964563030", "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED"}, "release_date": null, "administration_status": "APPROVED", "is_first": false, "release_status": "RELEASED", "release_type": "SCHEDULED", "pdp_metadata": {"application": {"default_locale": "en_US", "id": "8730228070435331", "is_first_party": false, "enables_in_app_ads": false, "is_concept": false, "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF"}, "iarc_cert": {"id": "1284797686381869"}, "iarc_email": null, "msrp": null, "translations": {"nodes": [{"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "GACLivewireBlankFull.png", "id": "1487876066155179", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825257_1487876069488512_5907524808358086001_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ofEmpAVf6gMQ7kNvwEwR7gl&_nc_oc=Adqjtbx0Q2Nw6_mw6klH_YzmYuRj3ae2ggjdC-sj8Q0N8MCY6LZQbq070thZx8fonwc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQT07wH4FNcFg064V6T8ZEZV02jQo4m-iF85IColHssAKQ&oe=6AE9DE8C"}]}, "id": "29869562735984483", "locale": "ro_RO", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Grow A Company - Cre\u0219te o Companie", "keywords": [], "long_description": "LIVEWIRE \u00eempinge Grow A Company \u0219i mai ad\u00e2nc \u00een haos prin sisteme **ARCFLOW** defecte, pene de curent \u00een \u00eentreaga pe\u0219ter\u0103, unit\u0103\u021bi **EXO-O9** care patruleaz\u0103 coridoarele, protocoale de oprire \u0219i evenimente de urgen\u021b\u0103 care pot opri complet produc\u021bia. Repar\u0103 **LIVEWIRES** sub presiune, stabilizeaz\u0103 pe\u0219tera \u0219i men\u021bine-\u021bi sta\u021bia func\u021bional\u0103 \u00een timp ce Compania urm\u0103re\u0219te fiecare gre\u0219eal\u0103.\n\n# Construie\u0219te, Vinde, Supravie\u021buie\u0219te... Poate Chiar Prosper\u0103.\n\nCondu o fabric\u0103 subteran\u0103 dubioas\u0103, proceseaz\u0103 \u201efear gear\u201d bizare, \u00eembun\u0103t\u0103\u021be\u0219te-\u021bi sta\u021bia, avanseaz\u0103 prin arborele tehnologic \u0219i supravie\u021buie\u0219te schimburilor tot mai ostile, unde sortarea gre\u0219it\u0103, penele de curent \u0219i evenimentele din pe\u0219ter\u0103 \u00ee\u021bi pot distruge \u00eentreaga echip\u0103.\n\n## \ud83d\udd27 \u00cembun\u0103t\u0103\u021be\u0219te-\u021bi Sta\u021bia\n\n* Upgradeaz\u0103 sta\u021bia cu procesoare mai rapide\n* Instaleaz\u0103 sisteme de stocare mai sigure\n* Automatizeaz\u0103 produc\u021bia pentru a men\u021bine opera\u021biunile active\n\n## \ud83e\uddea Scaneaz\u0103, Sorteaz\u0103 \u0219i Vinde\n\n1. Scaneaz\u0103 obiecte ciudate\n2. Sorteaz\u0103 materialele valoroase\n3. Vinde produsele balans\u00e2nd riscul \u0219i eficien\u021ba\n\n## \u26a1 Stabilizeaz\u0103 Pe\u0219tera\n\nRepar\u0103 **LIVEWIRES** \u0219i stabilizeaz\u0103 **ARCFLOW** \u00eenainte ca penele de curent, opririle de urgen\u021b\u0103 \u0219i unit\u0103\u021bile **EXO-O9** s\u0103 \u00ee\u021bi distrug\u0103 opera\u021biunea.\n\n## \ud83c\udf31 Accept\u0103 Haosul Controlat\n\n* Deblocheaz\u0103 upgrade-uri\n* Supravie\u021buie\u0219te evenimentelor aleatorii din pe\u0219ter\u0103\n* Adapteaz\u0103-te schimburilor din ce \u00een ce mai instabile\n\n## \ud83e\uddcd\u200d\u2642\ufe0f Solo sau Co-Op\n\nJoac\u0103 singur sau \u00eempreun\u0103 cu al\u021bii.\n\nCoordoneaz\u0103 repara\u021biile, gesti\n{1487876066155179}", "short_description": "LIVEWIRE \u00eempinge Grow A Company \u0219i mai ad\u00e2nc \u00een pene de curent la scar\u0103 larg\u0103, sisteme ARCFLOW instabile, unit\u0103\u021bi EXO-O9 care patruleaz\u0103 prin pe\u0219ter\u0103 \u0219i protocoale de oprire de urgen\u021b\u0103. Repar\u0103 LIVEWIRES sub presiune, men\u021bine produc\u021bia activ\u0103 \u0219i opre\u0219te pr\u0103bu\u0219irea pe\u0219terii \u00een jurul sta\u021biei tale.\n\nConstruie\u0219te, vinde, supravie\u021buie\u0219te... poate chiar prosper\u0103.\nCondu o fabric\u0103 subteran\u0103 dubioas\u0103, proceseaz\u0103 \u201efear gear\u201d bizare, \u00eembun\u0103t\u0103\u021be\u0219te-\u021bi sta\u021bia \u0219i p\u0103streaz\u0103 Compania mul\u021bumit\u0103: sau devino \u00eenc\u0103 u"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "layered_icon_composited.png", "id": "29384468711160956", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LAYERED_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/654975915_29384468721160955_2233290079324309630_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mY8A4ohAbicQ7kNvwFDdvEm&_nc_oc=AdrDSKk2YhYEOhL82McUw6nGAPDMxFEZrQrtVeCy5dHLEL9yhwWdcg4M4Ag4CQngilM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSKHNMdBQH-nK0K9D43if1YGP5YXJBIIt3EMakVjGHGDA&oe=6AE9FD12"}, {"file_name": "GACSecondGrandOpeningSquare.png", "id": "3177625242442199", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.c