dhoteW2CRL97qXFdc98t3I4mlbd4awXVrad31JNuKbdmQ9-rRm7w&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQS4RS8Tb3sT17htdCg3l4KYwKQNOdn7tdamjjBAJlG9Ww&oe=6AE9EA2D"}, {"file_name": "CameraCapture_20251222_120607.png", "id": "1393608892346649", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821193_1393608895679982_7017489360954712444_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZPcjigsFzhYQ7kNvwG0Jv8T&_nc_oc=AdpzwIT09HTFkfTsKSxHCppVGUTfJLN3C5EtJL7VZQRe5TC45bJFHnyQ6acsNZ3jj4E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQ_zlXKbSPvRYC4nkHJjpc6z965KJ6GbkuQQnSf1RG_sw&oe=6AEA128A"}, {"file_name": "Untitled.png", "id": "812815265068971", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819281_812815268402304_7110344871617182894_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=U4j3zhFDWQAQ7kNvwEc_h8W&_nc_oc=AdoNIWnb5wg1uAtbUc_qrl8YiFxM-nO6vs-LP44zdW4LLitxeFsLqsUEIQh4p4k3mqg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSCJZJ2H8ltFvnLeEpsyNAqQ-r3hgt_skR1LkMnxRo2ZQ&oe=6AE9FE34"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Grow A Company", "keywords": ["Horror", "Grow", "Lethal", "Factory", "Baboon"], "long_description": "**THE 2ND GRAND OPENING** expands Grow A Company with **The Company Store**, new cosmetics, **Company Credits**, and a completely revamped communal cave. Discover new ways to express yourself, relax with fellow employees, perform on the recreational stage, and enjoy the new **Casual Mode** without production quotas. With expanded facilities, new equipment, and more ways to spend your hard-earned money, The Company is proud to announce that it's opening its doors. Again.\n\n# Build, Sell, Survive... Maybe Even Thrive.\n\nRun a sketchy underground factory, process bizarre \u201cfear gear,\u201d upgrade your station, climb the tech tree, and survive increasingly hostile shifts where bad sorting, power failures, and cave events can drag your entire team down with you.\n\n## \ud83d\udd27 Upgrade Your Station\n\n* Upgrade your station with faster processors\n* Install safer storage systems\n* Automate production to keep operations moving\n\n## \ud83e\uddea Scan, Sort, and Sell\n\n1. Scan strange items\n2. Sort valuable materials\n3. Sell products while balancing risk and efficiency\n\n## \u26a1 Stabilize the Cave\n\nRepair **LIVEWIRES** and stabilize **ARCFLOW** before blackouts, shutdowns, and roaming **EXO-O9** units cripple your operation.\n\n## \ud83c\udf31 Embrace Controlled Chaos\n\n* Unlock upgrades\n* Survive random cave events\n* Adapt to increasingly unstable shifts\n\n## \ud83e\uddcd\u200d\u2642\ufe0f Solo or Co-Op Survival\n\nPlay solo or with others.\n\nCoordinate repairs, manage production, and survive together... or fail separately.\n\n# Become the Best Employee You Can Be...\n\nOr become another failed shift.\n\n{1100207889644042}", "short_description": "THE 2ND GRAND OPENING brings The Company Store, cosmetics, Company Credits, Casual Mode, and new communal spaces. Customize, socialize, and enjoy a workplace so great we had to open it twice.\n\nBuild, sell, survive... maybe even thrive.\nRun a sketchy underground factory, process bizarre \u201cfear gear,\u201d upgrade your station, and keep the Company satisfied: or become another failed shift."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://growacompany.online/privacypolicy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://growacompany.online/termsofservice", "publisher_name": "Maliba Entertainment ", "support_website_url": "https://discord.gg/bpZrJRAmmj", "website_url": "https://growacompany.online/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "644354873106712"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_